# No browser automation

Do not use Cursor's built-in browser in this repository. This overrides the general instruction to verify web UI changes in the browser.

- Do not call `cursor-ide-browser` tools: navigate, snapshot, click, type, fill, screenshot, lock, scroll, or CDP.
- Do not open localhost or app URLs in the embedded browser to check UI.

For UI, layout, or rendered-data changes, verify from the code, types, tests, or the dev-server log. Say that the browser was not used.

Desktop computer-use stays available.
